  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The single storey front extension measuring 15m in width and the undercroft to the side extension would be an overly dominant and uncharacteristic additions that would fail to relate subordinately to the main building and would have a contrived appearance that would result in harm to the character and appearance of the local area and streetscene contrary to local plan policies CC1 and CC2",
    "Reason : 2 - The undercroft would result in a loss of outlook and daylight as well as increased fumes and disturbance to the occupiers of flat 2. The undercroft would also create a dark and secluded environment for the entrance to the upper floor flat. The proposal would fail to provide a safe and acceptable quality of accommodation for the future occupants of the building contrary to Local Plan policy CC2, EQ4 and EC2."
  ],
